{"path":"locale/locale/name","title":"std::locale::name","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::locale::</span>name","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/locale/name","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the name of the locale, which is the name by which it is known to the operating system, such as \"POSIX\" or \"en_US.UTF8\" or \"English_United States.1252\".","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> name<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the name of the locale, which is the name by which it is known to the operating system, such as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"POSIX\"</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.UTF8\"</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"English_United States.1252\"</span></span></code>. If the locale is not a copy of a system-supplied locale, the string <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"*\"</span></span></code> is returned.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The name of the locale or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">\"*\"</span></span></code> if unnamed.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a> loc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, new <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1955\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The default locale is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">name</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The user's locale is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">name</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"A nameless locale is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> loc.<span class=\"me1\">name</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The default locale is C\nThe user's locale is en_US.UTF8\nA nameless locale is *</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/locale\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a new locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/locale","title":"std::locale"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::locale::name","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Returns the name of the locale, which is the name by which it is known to the operating system, such as \"POSIX\" or…"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The name of the locale or \"*\" if unnamed."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a new locale"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":134,"codeBlockCount":2}
